# Enchanted Evening (turn 1), Humility (turn 3), Opalescence (turn 5), worked out layer by layer (CR 613.1):
# - Layer 4: Evening makes every permanent an enchantment; Opalescence's "each other non-Aura enchantment is a creature"
#   depends on it (CR 613.8a) and applies after it. Every permanent but Opalescence is an enchantment creature: Evening,
#   Humility, the lands and the Moxes, Bot1's and Bot2's.
# - Layer 6: Humility's "all creatures lose all abilities" takes the abilities of all of them - Evening's own among them,
#   whose layer-4 effect has already applied and goes on applying (CR 613.6), Humility's own (its effect goes on too), and
#   the lands' mana abilities, which they have from layer 6's start (CR 305.6). Opalescence, no creature, keeps its ability.
# - Layer 7b: Humility's "base power and toughness 1/1" and Opalescence's "base power and toughness equal to its mana value"
#   are independent and apply in timestamp order (CR 613.7): Humility's first, Opalescence's last, so each is the size of
#   its mana value. The lands and Moxes are 0/0 and die (CR 704.5f); Evening is 5/5 and Humility 4/4.
# (humility-last-under-enchanted-evening-and-opalescence-... is the order where Humility's 7b part comes last.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Plains
Enchanted Evening
Humility
Plains
Opalescence
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Enchanted Evening.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Humility.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Humility.Types = Enchantment
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Opalescence.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

